  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Block phone numbers\"\nslug: \"/apps/desktop-blocklist--a279g7muy8kgbywr1ja8zwdo\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"Desktop\",\"General\",\"blocklist\",\"desktop\",\"working-with-contacts\"]\n---\n\n*Looking for an&#x20;*[Android](/docs/apps/android-blocklist--lg90ce3ygm72r214logejh7k) *or&#x20;*[iOS](/docs/apps/ios-blocklist--lchl96vtphrmdtytkicr7qo8) *version of this article?*\n\nYou can block incoming calls and SMS from the selected contacts and phone numbers.\n\n**NOTE:**&#x42;locked contacts are shared across your entire organisation, so if you block a number, it will also appear on other users' blocked list.\n\n## How to block a new contact\n\nTo block a new number:\n\n1. Navigate to Menu > Blocked.\n2. In the text field, enter the phone number, then click on that number under the \"New contact\" header.\n3. In the appeared pop-up, optionally specify the contact name and the reason for blocking this number.\n4. Press the \"Block\" button to confirm.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/68aa19c74c77ac3d24e2/21c7a2e61462b0558a56ee7acdca9b8169477998ce890058c5d04e6215b2f558.png)\n\n## How to block an existing contact\n\nTo block an existing contact:\n\n1. Navigate to Contacts tab.\n2. Find and select the contact in the list.\n3. In the contact profile, click on the three-dots menu and select \"Block\".\n4. Alternatively, right-click on the record in the contact list and in the context menu select \"Block\".\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/8b50af12012f7c3f92e1/b8991dbbf81dc9b8224a793c569179ddc42f352fa49cdfbceb2652e33ee57d31.png)\n\n## How to unblock a contact\n\nTo unblock a blocked contact:\n\n1. Navigate to Menu > Blocked.\n2. Find and select the contact in the list.\n3. In the blocked contact profile, click the \"Unblock\" button.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/b618cff3e3b44f77a96b/c848a9eacaccee2397a3acf8c05db68076846c80fadf19ebe48899b3980a341c.png)\n\n## Related articles\n\n- [Block phone numbers](/docs/apps/ios-blocklist--lchl96vtphrmdtytkicr7qo8)\n"
